<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<div class="wrap layout-with-sidebar">
  <div class="layout-main">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p class="lead"><%= siteDescription %></p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        <strong><%= siteName %></strong> means <em>Anime in Me</em> — the shows that got under the
        skin and never left. Not a corporate anime hub. A feed for people who can talk all day
        about the medium because it’s part of who they are.
      </p>
      <p>
        The shelf is wide on purpose. Dark classics like <em>Berserk</em> and <em>Monster</em>.
        Childhood powerhouses like <em>Dragon Ball</em>. Brain-melters like
        <em>Neon Genesis Evangelion</em>. Early-2000s and 2010s heat — <em>Akame ga Kill!</em>,
        <em>Attack on Titan</em>, tear-jerkers like <em>Your Lie in April</em>, and the “cultured”
        late-night picks (yes, <em>High School DxD</em> counts as homework).
      </p>
      <p>
        If you grew up on Toonami, burned fansub DVDs, forum flame wars, and still rewatch with the
        volume up — pull up. Neon, nostalgia, honest takes. No press-release energy.
      </p>
      <h2>What you’ll find here</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Reviews &amp; recaps</strong> — full series, seasons, and specials, spoiler-aware when it counts</li>
        <li><strong>Drama, action, mecha, and mayhem</strong> — from gut-punch stories to pure hype</li>
        <li><strong>News &amp; culture</strong> — drops, chart moments, and fandom noise worth your time</li>
        <li><strong>Genres &amp; series</strong> — browse by vibe or by title when you want the whole shelf on one work</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Team DBZ or Team Eva, Saturday morning or 2&nbsp;a.m. “just one more episode” —
        the grid’s still on. <strong>Anime in Me.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <% if (authors && authors.length) { %>
    <section class="authors" aria-labelledby="authors-heading">
      <h2 id="authors-heading" class="section-title">Who’s on the mic</h2>
      <div class="author-grid">
        <% authors.forEach(function (author) { %>
        <article class="card scanlines">
          <h3><%= author.displayName %></h3>
          <p class="muted">@<%= author.username %></p>
          <% if (author.bio) { %><p><%= author.bio %></p><% } %>
        </article>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
    </section>
    <% } %>
  </div>
  <%- include('../partials/sidebar') %>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
